  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Women, Peace and Security in Tanzania: A National Action Plan for the Development and Implementation of UN Security Council Resolution 1325</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The key objective of the project is to support Tanzania&#x2019;s development and adoption of a NAP to ensure that Tanzania meets its WPS commitments as envisioned under UN Security Council Resolution 1325 through strengthening capacities of governmental and non-governmental stakeholders. As such, the project aims to promote women&#x2019;s effective participation and active engagement within the peace and security agenda in an inclusive and meaningful manner. The project includes several activities that will be implemented simultaneously over the period from 1 February 2021 until 31 December 2022.</narrative>
  </description>
